# UI Components and Design System

## Component Library
- **Base Components**: shadcn/ui components in [components/ui/](mdc:components/ui) directory
- **Configuration**: Component library config in [components.json](mdc:components.json)
- **Theme Provider**: Custom theme handling in [ThemeProvider.tsx](mdc:components/ThemeProvider.tsx)

## Styling Guidelines
- **CSS Framework**: Tailwind CSS with config in [tailwind.config.ts](mdc:tailwind.config.ts)
- **Global Styles**: Base styles in [app/globals.css](mdc:app/globals.css)
- **Utility Functions**: Use `cn()` utility from [lib/utils.ts](mdc:lib/utils.ts) for conditional classes

## Component Standards
- Follow shadcn/ui conventions for component structure
- Use TypeScript interfaces for component props
- Implement proper accessibility attributes
- Support theme variations through CSS variables

## Available Components
Key UI components include:
- Form components: `form`, `input`, `textarea`, `select`, `checkbox`, `radio-group`
- Layout: `card`, `separator`, `sheet`, `dialog`
- Navigation: `navigation-menu`, `breadcrumb`, `tabs`
- Feedback: `toast`, `alert`, `progress`, `skeleton`
- Data display: `table`, `badge`, `avatar`, `tooltip`

## Component Usage
- Import components from `@/components/ui/[component-name]`
- Use composition over configuration
- Extend components through className prop when needed
- Maintain consistent spacing and sizing using Tailwind utilities